          "sha256": "0b2999de148804d4c187ba3e7684e9bb2f3ef6eeadbe0b6c61817713dee9f552"
        },
        {
          "version": "1.0.36",
          "downloadUrl": "https://github.com/Encaron/linkdesk-plugin-file-tree/releases/download/v1.0.36/file-tree.linkdesk-plugin",
          "publishedAt": "2026-11-23T22:35:38.241Z",
          "changelog": "- **路径工具归壳**：`basename/dirname/joinPath/extname/normalize` 全改走壳 `window.linkdesk.path.*`（`utils/hostPath.ts` 单向转入口，本仓零路径实现）；`pathUtils.ts` 只留结构类型与 `splitPath`。\n- **最近文件夹改宿主读取面**：不再跨属主读 `pluginState(\"app\",\"recentFolders\")`——改调 `workspace.getRecentFolders()` ＋ `onDidChangeRecentFolders`（归一化/去重/截断全在壳）。\n- **行高只吃宿主 token**：不再读 `app.uiFontScale` 配置键，改读 `:root` 的 `--ui-scale`，随 `theme:changed` 重算。"
        },
        {
          "version": "1.0.35",
          "downloadUrl": "https://github.com/Encaron/linkdesk-plugin-file-tree/releases/download/v1.0.35/file-tree.linkdesk-plugin",
          "publishedAt": "2026-11-23T16:39:31.024Z",
          "changelog": "- **i18n 收口**：命令/设置等 manifest 显示文本补齐英文；宿主按插件命名空间解析显示文本（市场/命令面板/菜单不再自己 t() 插件数据）。\n- **README 多语言**：新增 `docs/readme/en.md`，`plugin.json` 声明 `readme.locales`（zh→README.md，en→docs/readme/en.md）；共享图仍住 `resources/`。"
        },
